{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726590/extras/9abec686040284f82cb1ca6de369282f.poster.avif?t=1772125450\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726590/extras/9abec686040284f82cb1ca6de369282f.webm?t=1772125450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726590/extras/9abec686040284f82cb1ca6de369282f.mp4?t=1772125450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This product will no longer be available for purchase as of 2/20/2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: All multiplayer servers for NBA 2K Playgrounds 2 will be shutdown as of 8/20/2026. After that time, all game functions requiring online servers will no longer function.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NBA arcade action is back with NBA 2K Playgrounds 2! The sequel to the original smash hit takes street balling to the next level with a massive roster of current and retired NBA players, improved online matchmaking with dedicated servers, four-player online matches, three-point contests, new playgrounds, custom matches, and more! Pick your team, get ready to jam, and Ball Without Limits!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exciting Game Modes </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take street balling to the next level with a variety of exciting features, including new Season and Playgrounds Championship modes! Play 2-on-2locally with friends, four-player online games with improved matchmaking, or head-to-head three-point contests.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expanded Roster </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect over 400 NBA players, from all-time greats Michael Jordan, Kobe Bryant, &amp; Dr. J, to current stars Karl-Anthony Towns, Jayson Tatum, &amp; Ben Simmons. Featuring new player models and signature player animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726590/extras/badbad5c4924387387ac5e267c6d89aa.poster.avif?t=1772125450\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726590/extras/badbad5c4924387387ac5e267c6d89aa.webm?t=1772125450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726590/extras/badbad5c4924387387ac5e267c6d89aa.mp4?t=1772125450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >All-New Playgrounds </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flash your moves around the world on 10 all-new playground courts. Hit jumpers beachside in the California sun, prove your game under the bright lights of Seoul, or head down under and ball in the Australian outback.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"227e849fa2babc651804faeac37b3c439ffef531.jpg","localized_name":"In the Zone","name":"In the Zone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/726590/227e849fa2babc651804faeac37b3c439ffef531.jpg"},{"icon":"d7e046a5cd8cfebdbd4e44ea1c831a06e3c4401e.jpg","localized_name":"Fashionista","name":"Fashionista","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/726590/d7e046a5cd8cfebdbd4e44ea1c831a06e3c4401e.jpg"},{"icon":"db3ddc118d2f37ce427970757641e41cba922a73.jpg","localized_name":"Amateur Collector","name":"Amateur Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/726590/db3ddc118d2f37ce427970757641e41cba922a73.jpg"},{"icon":"00568e2436424c0d939cfa1d2d791a1dba7d5d98.jpg","localized_name":"One-Man Team","name":"One-Man Team","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/726590/00568e2436424c0d939cfa1d2d791a1dba7d5d98.jpg"},{"icon"